---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Nyx Solution — Agentic AI for Business Operations"
  description="Nyx Solution builds dependable AI agents that coordinate operational work across business systems."
>
  <style>
    :root{
      --ab-white:#fff;--ab-surface:#f6f6fa;--ab-line:#e5e5ee;
      --ab-ink:#17161f;--ab-soft:#4b4a5a;--ab-muted:#7c7b8c;
      --ab-accent:#4a3ad1;--ab-accent-dark:#35279c;--ab-deep:#231551;
      --ab-display:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;
      --ab-body:'Sora',sans-serif;--ab-mono:'DM Mono',monospace;
    }
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:var(--ab-white);color:var(--ab-ink);font-family:var(--ab-body);overflow-x:hidden}
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    .ab-container{width:min(1160px,calc(100vw - 3rem));margin:0 auto}

    .ab-nav{position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto;z-index:20;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,242,255,.16)}
    .ab-nav__inner{min-height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem}
    .ab-brand{font-family:var(--ab-display);font-size:1.42rem;line-height:1;color:var(--ab-ink);text-shadow:0 1px 12px rgba(255,255,255,.72)}
    .ab-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2rem;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
    .ab-links a{font-family:var(--ab-mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ab-soft);text-shadow:0 1px 10px rgba(255,255,255,.8);transition:color .2s}
    .ab-links a:hover,.ab-links a[aria-current='page']{color:var(--ab-accent)}

    .ab-hero{position:relative;width:100%;height:min(100svh,1024px);min-height:0;overflow:hidden;background:#faf9fb}
    .ab-hero__image{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:right center;display:block}
    .ab-hero__inner{position:relative;z-index:1;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-top:68px}
    .ab-hero__copy{width:min(37%,460px);margin-top:-7rem}
    .ab-hero h1{margin:0;font-family:var(--ab-display);font-size:clamp(2.75rem,4.25vw,4.25rem);font-weight:400;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.035em}
    .ab-hero h1 em{display:block;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:var(--ab-accent)}
    .ab-hero p{max-width:42ch;margin:1.25rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(.84rem,1.05vw,.98rem);font-weight:300;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ab-soft)}

    .ab-summary{min-height:100svh;padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,6rem) 0;display:flex;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ab-line)}
    .ab-summary__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:clamp(3rem,8vw,7.5rem);align-items:center}
    .ab-eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:.65rem;font-family:var(--ab-mono);font-size:.64rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ab-accent)}
    .ab-summary h2,.ab-founders h2,.ab-cta h2{margin:0;font-family:var(--ab-display);font-size:clamp(2rem,3.4vw,3rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.018em}
    .ab-summary h2{max-width:12ch;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.2vw,4rem);line-height:1.02}
    .ab-summary h2 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--ab-accent)}
    .ab-summary__copy{display:grid;gap:1.25rem;padding-top:.2rem}
    .ab-summary__copy p{max-width:59ch;margin:0;font-size:.98rem;font-weight:300;line-height:1.78;color:var(--ab-soft)}
    .ab-summary__copy p:first-child{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.35vw,1.2rem);line-height:1.65;color:var(--ab-ink)}

    .ab-founders{position:relative;isolation:isolate;min-height:100svh;padding:clamp(4.5rem,6vw,5.5rem) 0;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#21164e;color:#f4f2ff;overflow:hidden}
    .ab-founders::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;opacity:.55;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(169,156,255,.055) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(169,156,255,.055) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:64px 64px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent,#000 16%,#000 84%,transparent)}
    .ab-founders__head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:1.75rem;padding-bottom:1.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(169,156,255,.2)}
    .ab-founders .ab-eyebrow{color:#b7adff}
    .ab-founders__head h2{color:#fff}
    .ab-founders__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0;border:1px solid rgba(169,156,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.018)}
    .ab-founder{min-width:0;padding:1.25rem;background:transparent;color:#f4f2ff}
    .ab-founder+ .ab-founder{border-left:1px solid rgba(169,156,255,.22)}
    .ab-founder__photo{width:100%;height:clamp(350px,31vw,455px);background:#292832;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(244,242,255,.12)}
    .ab-founder__photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;filter:saturate(.88) contrast(1.02);transform:none;transition:none}
    .ab-founder__meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;gap:.2rem 1.5rem;padding:1.15rem .15rem .2rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(169,156,255,.16)}
    .ab-founder__index{grid-column:1/-1;margin-bottom:.5rem;font-family:var(--ab-mono);font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b7adff}
    .ab-founder h3{margin:0;font-family:var(--ab-display);font-size:clamp(1.65rem,2.2vw,2.15rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1;color:#fff}
    .ab-founder p{margin:0 0 .12rem;font-family:var(--ab-mono);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(244,242,255,.62);text-align:right}

    .ab-cta{padding:4.5rem 0;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--ab-line)}
    .ab-cta h2{max-width:18ch;margin:0 auto}
    .ab-cta a{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1.5rem;padding:.75rem 1.35rem;border-radius:4px;background:var(--ab-accent);color:#fff;font-family:var(--ab-mono);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:background .2s}
    .ab-cta a:hover{background:var(--ab-accent-dark)}

    @media(max-width:900px){
      .ab-hero__copy{width:40%;margin-top:-3rem}
      .ab-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.2rem)}
      .ab-hero p{font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.6}
      .ab-summary__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.35rem}
    }
    @media(max-width:680px){
      .ab-container{width:min(100% - 2rem,1160px)}
      .ab-nav__inner{min-height:82px;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:1rem;gap:.65rem;flex-direction:column}
      .ab-links{gap:.9rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
      .ab-links a{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.04em}
      .ab-hero{height:auto;aspect-ratio:auto;padding-top:83px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#faf9fb}
      .ab-hero__inner{order:1;height:auto;width:min(100% - 2rem,36rem);padding:2.5rem 0 2rem;text-align:center;background:#faf9fb}
      .ab-hero__copy{width:100%;margin:0 auto}
      .ab-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.55rem,12vw,3.5rem);line-height:.98}
      .ab-hero h1 em{display:inline;color:var(--ab-accent)}
      .ab-hero p{max-width:35rem;margin:1.15rem auto 0;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.7}
      .ab-hero__image{position:static;order:2;width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:-18px;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0,#000 28px);mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0,#000 28px)}
      .ab-summary{min-height:100svh;padding:2rem 0 8rem}
      .ab-summary__grid{gap:1.5rem}
      .ab-summary h2{max-width:11ch;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,11vw,3rem)}
      .ab-summary__copy{gap:1rem}
      .ab-summary__copy p{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.68}
      .ab-summary__copy p:first-child{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}
      .ab-founders{min-height:0;padding:4rem 0}
      .ab-founders__head{display:block;margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem}
      .ab-founders__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .ab-founder{padding:1rem}
      .ab-founder+ .ab-founder{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(169,156,255,.22)}
      .ab-founder__photo{height:min(112vw,430px)}
      .ab-founder__meta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.2rem;padding-top:1rem}
      .ab-founder p{text-align:left}
      .ab-cta{padding:3.8rem 0}
    }
  </style>

  <nav class="ab-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <div class="ab-container ab-nav__inner">
      <a class="ab-brand" href="/">Nyx Solution</a>
      <ul class="ab-links">
        <li><a href="/#what-we-do">Agentic AI</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" aria-current="page">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/products">Products</a></li>
        <li><a href="/careers">Careers</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="ab-hero">
      <img class="ab-hero__image" src="/assets/images/nyx-about-agent-workflows-hero.png" alt="Nyx AI agent coordinating verified workflows across business systems" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="ab-container ab-hero__inner">
        <div class="ab-hero__copy">
          <h1>We build AI agents for the work <em>between business systems.</em></h1>
          <p>We create human-governed AI agents that understand context, coordinate workflows, and take approved actions across the business systems your team already uses.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab-summary">
      <div class="ab-container ab-summary__grid">
        <div>
          <span class="ab-eyebrow">How Nyx works</span>
          <h2>From scattered inputs to a <em>verified result.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-summary__copy">
          <p>Nyx agents understand the documents, messages, and live system data behind an operational task, then apply your rules to determine the next step.</p>
          <p>They coordinate the workflow across TallyPrime, SAP, ERP, email, and WhatsApp—pausing for approval when needed and recording every action back in the right system.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab-founders" id="founders">
      <div class="ab-container">
        <div class="ab-founders__head">
          <span class="ab-eyebrow">Founders</span>
          <h2>The people behind Nyx</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-founders__grid">
          <article class="ab-founder">
            <div class="ab-founder__photo"><img src="/Yash.png" alt="Yash Puri" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
            <div class="ab-founder__meta"><span class="ab-founder__index">01 · Founder</span><h3>Yash Puri</h3><p>Co-Founder &amp; CEO</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="ab-founder">
            <div class="ab-founder__photo"><img src="/Shubham.png" alt="Shubham Tribhuwan" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
            <div class="ab-founder__meta"><span class="ab-founder__index">02 · Founder</span><h3>Shubham Tribhuwan</h3><p>Co-Founder &amp; CPO</p></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ab-cta">
      <div class="ab-container">
        <span class="ab-eyebrow">Start with one workflow</span>
        <h2>See where an AI agent can help your team</h2>
        <a href="/contact">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
